%% Option F. Parts only: DFT geometry optimization
%% Materials science: a DFT geometry optimization (relaxation) of a crystal structure.

    Relaxation["<b>DFT relaxation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::local
    Spec["<b>Relaxation settings</b><br>IAO_0000104 plan specification<br><br>is a: simulation specification"]:::proposed
    Task["<b>Find the lowest-energy structure</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>is a: equilibrium task"]:::proposed
    Solve["<b>Solve the Kohn-Sham equations</b><br>PMD_0000583 computing process<br><br>is a: model solution process"]:::proposed
    DFTModel["<b>DFT model</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>is a: physics-based model"]:::proposed
    KS["<b>Kohn-Sham equations</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>is a: electronic physics equation"]:::proposed
    PBE["<b>PBE functional</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>is a: materials relation"]:::proposed
    SCF["<b>SCF and BFGS</b><br>PMD_0000931 simulation method specification<br><br>is a: numerical method<br>cutoff, k-points, force threshold"]:::proposed
    Structure["<b>Starting crystal structure</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity"]:::local
    Relaxed["<b>Relaxed structure and total energy</b><br>PMD_0025035 calculation datum"]:::local
    Code["<b>DFT code</b><br>IAO_0000010 software<br><br>name, version"]:::local
    Node["<b>Cluster node</b><br>PMD_0000582 computing device"]:::local
    Note["<b>What to look at</b><br>The same data as in option E.<br>Nothing is inferred in the core. Geometry optimization is a query (equilibrium task, and a model<br>with an electronic or atomistic equation), or a class in a domain ontology."]:::note

    Relaxation -. "executes<br>STATO_0000102" .-> Spec
    Spec -. "has part<br>BFO_0000051" .-> Task
